*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : CRD0042
*> PURPOSE : CREDIT APPROVAL RULES
*> AUTHOR  : L.B.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1989-05-19 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 973
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB CRDNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRD0042.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> BUREAU CREDIT SCORE
    05 WS-CSCR            PIC 9(3).
    05 G-INC              PIC 9(7)V99.
    05 PROC-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 PROC-DATE-R REDEFINES PROC-DATE.
       10 PROC-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 PROC-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 PROC-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> ASSIGNED CREDIT LIMIT
    05 C-LM               PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM SET-CARD-LIMIT
    DISPLAY "C-LM=" C-LM
    STOP RUN.
SET-CARD-LIMIT.
    EVALUATE TRUE
        WHEN WS-CSCR >= 740
            COMPUTE C-LM = G-INC * 0.30
        *> STANDARD CREDIT LIMIT
        WHEN WS-CSCR >= 660
            COMPUTE C-LM = G-INC * 0.20
        WHEN OTHER
            MOVE 1000 TO C-LM
    END-EVALUATE.
